{"id":"efd61e76586d57ab","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-release-axiom.md","title":"释放公理","display":"df-release-axiom — 释放公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-release-axiom","aliases":["91-df-release-axiom","91-df-release"],"display":"df-release-axiom — 释放公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-release-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-release-axiom</span><span>91-df-release</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-release-axiom — 释放公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-release-axiom-—-释放公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}$\">df-release-axiom — 释放公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}release\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\frac{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}{\\varphi}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}release\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\frac{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}{\\varphi}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span> : 释放公理（release axiom）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> : PA扩展真理谓词后的理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可推导关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>释放公理的含义：\n释放原则是一条推理规则：从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>推导<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>；它不是把两个元层可证性断言放进对象层蕴涵。</p>\n<p>释放公理与捕获公理共同构成真理理论的&quot;反射机制&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>捕获：PA可证性 → 真理可证性</li>\n<li>释放：真理可证性 → 句子可证性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者确保真理谓词忠实地反映基础理论的证明能力，形成真理与证明之间的双向桥梁。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-release-axiom-—-释放公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}$","text":"df-release-axiom — 释放公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}release\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\frac{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}{\\varphi}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{rel}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1394,"backlinks":[{"id":"387103572d3822c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd9d450264433858","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-release-axiom]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-33